// Hotdog Stand
// The legendary Windows 3.1 color scheme, reborn for Bitwig Studio
// Simultaneously the worst and best color scheme ever devised by humanity
// Pure #FF0000 RED and #FFFF00 YELLOW with BLACK for contrast
// Intentionally garish but still usable - black text ensures readability
// Flat knobs for Windows 3.1 aesthetic
// Author: Claude

